# ─── Internal AI-tooling guide + MCP config (references the excluded VibeUE plugin) ───
CLAUDE.md
.mcp.json

# ─── Fab-pack promo/reference art (seller: Code This Lab) — not redistributable ───
White_Football_Player.png

# ─── Cook artifact — file-open-order log embeds machine paths (regenerated each cook) ───
Build/*/FileOpenOrder/

# ─── Redundant auto-imported splash textures (the .bmp files ARE the splash; these embed the import path) ───
Content/Splash/*.uasset

